# A door frame (100 by 100)
#
# Created by Bernie Roehl, November 1992

# The dimensions of the frame are 100 by 100, with the frame 
# being 35 in from each edge of the frame

# The colors 0x8001 and 0x8002 are the "front" and "back" colors of the
# wall.

frame 10 6

0 0 0
0 100 0
35 100 0
65 100 0
100 100 0
100 0 0
65 0 0
65 65 0
35 65 0
35 0 0

# Front side

0x8001 4 0 1 2 9
0x8001 4 2 3 7 8
0x8001 4 3 4 5 6

# Back side

0x8002 4 9 2 1 0
0x8002 4 8 7 3 2
0x8002 4 6 5 4 3

# End of dframe.plg
